  - [1mLogout button + logged-in indicator[0m — [38;5;153mindex.html[39m gains a "Signed in as X / Log out" region the session drives. More
    useful immediately; costs real DOM work and a second render path in a file that currently has none.

  I lean [1mAPI only[0m, on YAGNI: you described the identity layer as groundwork for later forms, not as a UI change, and the
  UI is the cheap direction to add afterward.
